From 4f3aca4e936028d35d30b2f1cbca601aa44fba12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UbyHost orchestrator <orchestrator@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:36:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Task 0003: log in by e-mail link, remove passwords

Hard cutover from username and password to a single-use login link mailed to
the account address. TOTP stays optional as a second step. Admins invite hosts
by e-mail; hosts change their login address with a confirmation link to the new
address and a notice to the old one. Staging never shows a link on the page;
it writes link mails to the service log.
